  "content": "\n\n<p>一個小型資源包，為 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/village-taverns\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Village Taverns</a> 與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/brewin-and-chewin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Brewin' And Chewin'</a> 之間新增相容性</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>此資源包主要為 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/dungeon-heroes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dungeon Heroes</a> 整合包而製作！</p>\n<p><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_d589d0c8-12c0-4615-83c6-d13c9253147f.png\" width=\"369\" height=\"216\"><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_1a01e507-5c42-40c5-a496-59629ea97b87.png\" width=\"370\" height=\"217\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/dungeon-heroes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/797/189/logo_ramparts_bg.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"738\" height=\"309\"></a></p>\n<p>感謝 Chefs Delight Discord 中的 Probleyes 允許上傳此資源包！</p>",
